304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_sd_intervention"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sel_23","span_sd_drug","span_sd_dose","span_sd_placebo","span_sd_intervention"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的研究药物为合成试验药A，属于小分子药物，剂型为口服固体制剂，经口服途径给药，为全身暴露药物。在双盲治疗期内，试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次（QD），自第1天给药至第16周；对照组受试者接受与合成试验药A匹配的安慰剂，每日一次（QD）口服，给药时间为第1天至第16周。受试者的用药依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实：试验药物为合成试验药A，药物技术类型为小分子，给药途径为口服，剂型为口服固体制剂，暴露范围为全身性；试验组给药方案为100 mg每日一次（QD）口服、第1天至第16周，对照组为匹配安慰剂且给药期相同；依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。医学作者需核对研究药物的作用机制、药代动力学特征、规格与包装信息、匹配安慰剂的具体匹配属性，以及本章是否需引用研究者手册；现有可用证据未包含上述内容。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_2b3b651762037aa3","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:71ced0bdac123e50061220aa","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:b5cb8043e0359e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:367cbc36976ba5","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:d84680fc442c0c"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922052056_c3aa4a4c","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"非临床